# Real ER diagrams may contain confidential schema information
*.a5er

# Exact allowlist: the catalogued synthetic fixtures are committed under their real
# `.a5er` extension. One line per file, deliberately no directory wildcard, so any
# other `.a5er` file (including a new one in this directory) stays ignored.
